    "isoId": "_R3MOKzEZEe6kQ-WGAhcVPQ",
    "definition": "Scope|The GetReservation message is sent by a member to the transaction administrator.|It is used to request information on the details of one or more reservation facilities set by the member and managed by the transaction administrator.|Usage|The member can request reservations information based on the following elements:|- identification of the system;|- identification of the account;|- status of the reservation (default and/or current);|- type of reservation.|This message will be replied to by a ReturnReservation message.",
